		{
			"to": "mathematics/incommensurable",
			"why": "Zhu's first step was the square root of 2, the diagonal of a square with sides of ten, which that frame shows is no ratio of whole numbers; the equal semitone, the twelfth root of 2, is irrational for the same reason."
		}
